    "narrative": "For today\u2019s slate, **Corbin Carroll** (77.21) and **Mickey Moniak** (72.51) anchor the outfield as our clear-cut priority starts. **Corbin Carroll** benefits from a rare, favorable interaction with McDonald\u2019s delivery, as the pitcher\u2019s slow windup grants a 4% efficiency boost specifically tailored to our pursuit of elite stolen bases. Simultaneously, **Mickey Moniak** is in a prime spot against Meyer, leveraging a massive 14% park factor and a strong platoon advantage that escalates his production potential. While **Brice Turang** (67.08) isn\u2019t facing a \"soft\" arm, the favorable matchup against Abbott\u2019s 4.92 xERA, combined with the #2 order slot, cements his status as a high-floor play essential for our daily efficiency targets.\n\nWe are navigating a few tactical tradeoffs in the infield and bench. **Austin Riley** (61.66) and **Isaac Paredes** (60.90) remain solid, with **Austin Riley** specifically thriving on a favorable SP skill matchup against McGreevy, while **Isaac Paredes** leans on a potent platoon edge against Bradley. The tightest decision today was leaving **Henry Bolte** (44.25) on the bench. While his park factors were excellent, the sharp xERA of Dreyer\u2014who acts as a significant \"SP skill\" anchor\u2014suppressed his ceiling just enough to keep him behind the more consistent production profiles of **Zach McKinstry** and **Kyle Karros**. \n\nRegarding risk management, we remain cautious of the volatility surrounding **Jose Caballero** and **Kyle Karros**, both of whom are hindered by poor batting order positioning (Slot #8) and elite-hold pitchers who minimize their stolen base utility. We are also keeping a watchful eye on **Seiya Suzuki**; his 60.27 score is buoyed by a wind-out projection, providing a necessary buffer against his middling matchup with Buehler. As a reminder, we are continuing to manage game caps carefully, so while **Edwin Arroyo** sits below our 40-point floor, we have opted to bench him rather than risk inefficient volume in a challenging matchup against Drohan.",
